<section>
<h2>1. Introduction</h2>
<p>
ZimPlug Music respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains
what information may be collected when you use the website, how
that information may be used, and the choices available to you.
</p>
</section>

<section>
<h2>2. Information We May Collect</h2>
<p>Depending on how you use the platform, we may process:</p>
<ul>
<li>Account information such as your name and email address.</li>
<li>Information you provide when contacting us.</li>
<li>Music, artist or creator information submitted to the platform.</li>
<li>Technical information such as browser type, device information and IP address.</li>
<li>Basic usage information needed to operate and improve the service.</li>
</ul>
</section>

<section>
<h2>3. How We Use Information</h2>
<ul>
<li>To provide and operate ZimPlug Music.</li>
<li>To create and manage accounts.</li>
<li>To provide music discovery and download functionality.</li>
<li>To respond to support requests and reports.</li>
<li>To protect the platform against abuse and security threats.</li>
<li>To improve reliability, performance and user experience.</li>
</ul>
</section>

<section>
<h2>4. Music Downloads</h2>
<p>
When you download a song, your browser may communicate with our
servers and/or the server hosting the file. Technical information
associated with that request may be processed for security,
delivery and operational purposes.
</p>
</section>

<section>
<h2>5. Cookies & Similar Technologies</h2>
<p>
ZimPlug Music may use cookies or similar technologies for functions
such as maintaining sessions, remembering preferences, improving
security and understanding basic website usage.
</p>
</section>

<section>
<h2>6. Information Sharing</h2>
<p>
We do not intend to sell your personal information. Information may
be shared with service providers where reasonably necessary to
operate the website, comply with legal obligations, prevent abuse,
or protect the rights and safety of ZimPlug Music and its users.
</p>
</section>

<section>
<h2>7. Data Security</h2>
<p>
We take reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect
information. However, no internet service can guarantee absolute
security.
</p>
</section>

<section>
<h2>8. Your Choices</h2>
<p>
Depending on applicable law, you may have rights to request access,
correction or deletion of certain personal information. You may
also contact us about privacy questions or concerns.
</p>
</section>

<section>
<h2>9. Children</h2>
<p>
ZimPlug Music is not intended to knowingly collect personal
information from children in circumstances where doing so would
violate applicable law.
</p>
</section>

<section>
<h2>10. Changes</h2>
<p>
This Privacy Policy may be updated when the service, technology or
legal requirements change. The updated version will be published on
this page.
</p>
</section>

<section>
